1
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:12,000
"Echo Of A Letter"
(Episode 3)

2
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:14,039
Are you Mr. Chen Wan?

3
00:00:14,879 --> 00:00:16,958
Mr. Chen, please cooperate
with our investigation into a case.

4
00:00:16,959 --> 00:00:17,959
This way, please.

5
00:00:25,680 --> 00:00:26,160
Mr. Zhao.

6
00:00:26,520 --> 00:00:27,520
Where to now?

7
00:00:30,680 --> 00:00:31,680
Miwang Road.

8
00:00:33,759 --> 00:00:35,639
Why isn't Shengge here yet?

9
00:00:35,640 --> 00:00:37,239
I'm starving.

10
00:00:38,320 --> 00:00:39,398
He should be here soon.

11
00:00:39,399 --> 00:00:41,055
He said he was on his
way just a moment ago.

12
00:00:41,079 --> 00:00:42,079
Sorry I'm late.

13
00:00:42,200 --> 00:00:43,200
Kept you waiting.

14
00:00:43,559 --> 00:00:44,879
You owe us a penalty drink later.

15
00:00:48,919 --> 00:00:50,520
You seem to be in a good mood.

16
00:00:51,480 --> 00:00:52,480
Always am.

17
00:00:53,040 --> 00:00:54,040
Shengge,

18
00:00:54,359 --> 00:00:55,879
how did things go with Shao Yaozong?

19
00:00:56,800 --> 00:00:58,519
Being able to negotiate
with Shao Yaozong this time

20
00:00:58,520 --> 00:00:59,895
was all thanks to Mr. Jiang setting it up.

21
00:00:59,919 --> 00:01:01,376
We still need to keep a close
eye on it moving forward.

22
00:01:01,400 --> 00:01:02,840
Don't worry, I'll stay on top of it.

23
00:01:03,040 --> 00:01:04,560
Since we're off to such a great start,

24
00:01:04,760 --> 00:01:06,440
why don't we head out to sea to celebrate?

25
00:01:06,639 --> 00:01:07,639
Sounds good.

26
00:01:08,040 --> 00:01:09,520
Then let's take Whale Cruiser 17.

27
00:01:10,200 --> 00:01:11,918
It's been sitting idle
since its maiden voyage.

28
00:01:11,919 --> 00:01:13,999
We can set sail right from Lai Chun Wun.

29
00:01:14,680 --> 00:01:15,680
Making such a big splash?

30
00:01:16,279 --> 00:01:18,456
You want the shipping tycoon Ho
family to see what you're made of,

31
00:01:18,480 --> 00:01:19,600
and Lai Chun Wun's potential?

32
00:01:19,999 --> 00:01:21,039
Exactly.

33
00:01:21,040 --> 00:01:22,759
Isn't the shipping tycoon's
granddaughter, Xu Zhiying,

34
00:01:22,760 --> 00:01:24,615
the granddaughter-in-law
your old man has his eye on?

35
00:01:24,639 --> 00:01:26,119
You want to bring them into the fold?

36
00:01:27,760 --> 00:01:30,159
I hear she's returning
from abroad any day now.

37
00:01:30,799 --> 00:01:32,760
I've dealt with Xu Zhiying before.

38
00:01:32,960 --> 00:01:34,000
She's no walk in the park.

39
00:01:34,439 --> 00:01:35,519
Anyway, enough about that.

40
00:01:35,719 --> 00:01:37,399
Whale Cruiser 17 is massive.

41
00:01:37,400 --> 00:01:39,320
With just the few of
us, we'd get lost in there.

42
00:01:40,240 --> 00:01:41,240
Then invite some people.

43
00:01:41,760 --> 00:01:42,800
I want to invite Chen Wan.

44
00:01:44,040 --> 00:01:45,040
Suit yourself.

45
00:01:55,760 --> 00:01:56,760
I didn't say no.

46
00:01:56,919 --> 00:01:58,319
Leave this to me.

47
00:01:58,320 --> 00:01:59,439
Don't you worry.

48
00:02:00,439 --> 00:02:02,799
I'll make sure everyone who
should be there gets an invite.

49
00:02:03,919 --> 00:02:04,400
Let's go.

50
00:02:04,400 --> 00:02:05,400
Pick a bottle of wine.

51
00:02:11,240 --> 00:02:12,799
Chen Wan has been swamped lately.

52
00:02:12,999 --> 00:02:13,960
These days,

53
00:02:13,961 --> 00:02:15,281
another issue came up at Kexiang.

54
00:02:15,519 --> 00:02:17,199
He barely has time to sleep.

55
00:02:17,200 --> 00:02:18,518
I told him it was you

56
00:02:18,519 --> 00:02:20,319
inviting everyone out to sea,

57
00:02:20,320 --> 00:02:21,719
and he agreed immediately.

58
00:02:21,720 --> 00:02:23,360
He even asked if we needed an extra hand.

59
00:02:23,839 --> 00:02:24,880
Wan is just like that.

60
00:02:25,200 --> 00:02:26,200
Always so considerate.

61
00:02:26,239 --> 00:02:28,320
People are always coming to him for help,

62
00:02:28,560 --> 00:02:29,918
unlike those trust-fund heirs

63
00:02:29,919 --> 00:02:30,919
who only show up for the party

64
00:02:30,920 --> 00:02:32,040
and can't help with a thing.

65
00:02:32,119 --> 00:02:33,456
There'll be a big crowd this time,

66
00:02:33,480 --> 00:02:34,760
with plenty of unfamiliar faces.

67
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:36,040
Not all of them know Wan,

68
00:02:36,760 --> 00:02:38,760
and they might not know
how to treat him properly.

69
00:02:39,399 --> 00:02:41,759
Don't let anyone look down on him.

70
00:02:41,760 --> 00:02:42,976
Of course.

71
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:44,639
Wan is my friend too.

72
00:02:48,600 --> 00:02:50,078
I brought him along to unwind.

73
00:02:50,079 --> 00:02:51,519
Just don't run him ragged.

74
00:02:51,760 --> 00:02:53,839
Alright, alright, got it.

75
00:03:02,399 --> 00:03:02,880
Boss.

76
00:03:03,079 --> 00:03:04,159
Officer Ho got back to us.

77
00:03:04,160 --> 00:03:05,199
He said his lips were sealed tight.

78
00:03:05,200 --> 00:03:06,200
They interrogated him for an hour,

79
00:03:06,201 --> 00:03:07,678
and he didn't utter your name once.

80
00:03:07,679 --> 00:03:08,838
He claimed he was just doing a good deed,

81
00:03:08,839 --> 00:03:10,359
guiding some Mainland tourists around.

82
00:03:10,560 --> 00:03:11,560
Anything else?

83
00:03:12,560 --> 00:03:13,440
They checked his phone.

84
00:03:13,441 --> 00:03:15,518
No record of any contact with the White Crane Hall.

85
00:03:15,519 --> 00:03:17,000
No prior record either.

86
00:03:17,119 --> 00:03:17,839
He's completely clean.

87
00:03:17,840 --> 00:03:19,079
Good. I understand.

88
00:03:20,519 --> 00:03:21,519
Shengge.

89
00:03:24,639 --> 00:03:25,639
Where did Nianzai go?

90
00:03:27,760 --> 00:03:28,760
I don't know either.

91
00:03:37,079 --> 00:03:39,439
Mr. Chen, when does the outdoor pool open?

92
00:03:39,440 --> 00:03:41,078
It will be open in about half an hour.

93
00:03:41,079 --> 00:03:41,839
Just a short wait.

94
00:03:41,919 --> 00:03:42,919
Okay.

95
00:03:43,959 --> 00:03:44,519
Mr. Chen,

96
00:03:44,919 --> 00:03:46,918
any good wines in the
cellar you'd recommend?

97
00:03:46,919 --> 00:03:48,918
I'll have the manager bring you a list.

98
00:03:48,919 --> 00:03:50,638
I'd suggest a champagne we just brought in.

99
00:03:50,639 --> 00:03:51,480
It's crisp and refreshing,

100
00:03:51,481 --> 00:03:52,519
perfect for this weather.

101
00:03:52,760 --> 00:03:53,760
Thank you.

102
00:03:56,280 --> 00:03:57,280
Young Master Zhuo.

103
00:03:57,320 --> 00:03:58,439
Hey, don't look at me.

104
00:03:58,440 --> 00:03:59,280
Without him,

105
00:03:59,281 --> 00:04:00,359
I'd be totally lost.

106
00:04:01,440 --> 00:04:03,279
It's as if this yacht belongs to Chen Wan.

107
00:04:03,280 --> 00:04:05,638
He already knows every corner inside out.

108
00:04:05,639 --> 00:04:06,678
Regarding that project from last time,

109
00:04:06,679 --> 00:04:08,119
we're already sixty percent through.

110
00:04:09,280 --> 00:04:10,440
Here comes Mr. Busy.

111
00:04:11,440 --> 00:04:12,559
Not nearly as busy as you.

112
00:04:12,560 --> 00:04:13,480
Right, right.

113
00:04:13,480 --> 00:04:14,480
Much obliged, big boss.

114
00:04:17,320 --> 00:04:17,919
Let's set sail.

115
00:04:17,919 --> 00:04:18,440
Right away.

116
00:04:18,880 --> 00:04:19,880
Go ahead.

117
00:04:21,799 --> 00:04:23,678
A shipment of fine wine arrived at
my dad's place a couple of days ago.

118
00:04:23,679 --> 00:04:24,679
I grabbed a bottle.

119
00:04:24,680 --> 00:04:25,720
Let's crack it open later.

120
00:04:25,959 --> 00:04:27,799
A whole shipment and
you only took one bottle?

121
00:04:27,880 --> 00:04:29,560
Then I definitely have to give it a taste.

122
00:04:34,200 --> 00:04:34,719
Mr. Chen,

123
00:04:34,719 --> 00:04:35,719
have a drink.

124
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:41,920
Distinguished guests,

125
00:04:41,921 --> 00:04:44,320
this is an announcement
from Whale Cruiser 17.

126
00:04:44,479 --> 00:04:46,999
We have officially entered
international waters.

127
00:04:47,000 --> 00:04:49,278
When moving along the decks and railings,

128
00:04:49,279 --> 00:04:50,279
please mind your safety.

129
00:04:50,399 --> 00:04:51,638
We wish you a wonderful voyage.

130
00:04:51,639 --> 00:04:52,760
Unbelievable!

131
00:04:55,279 --> 00:04:56,399
Young Master Qin is on fire!

132
00:04:56,920 --> 00:04:58,119
Like father, like son.

133
00:04:58,120 --> 00:05:00,400
His father is the stock
market king of Haishi, after all.

134
00:05:01,599 --> 00:05:02,599
Here comes Zhao Shengge.

135
00:05:18,880 --> 00:05:19,880
Mr. Zhao.

136
00:05:19,920 --> 00:05:20,920
Mr. Tan.

137
00:05:25,760 --> 00:05:26,240
Zongnian,

138
00:05:26,240 --> 00:05:26,760
take a seat.

139
00:05:27,200 --> 00:05:29,239
Having Shen Zongnian
play is practically cheating.

140
00:05:29,240 --> 00:05:30,398
I'm sitting this out too.

141
00:05:30,399 --> 00:05:31,879
Who can beat Young Master Qin anyway?

142
00:05:32,959 --> 00:05:34,079
Unless...

143
00:05:34,760 --> 00:05:35,920
Unless we have Chen Wan deal.

144
00:05:37,560 --> 00:05:38,638
What's the angle?

145
00:05:38,639 --> 00:05:40,000
You'll see in a minute.

146
00:05:40,120 --> 00:05:41,120
Wan.

147
00:05:47,839 --> 00:05:49,398
Since you've asked me to deal,

148
00:05:49,399 --> 00:05:50,919
and we're out in international waters,

149
00:05:51,599 --> 00:05:53,959
let's go by the golden rule of
Young Master Shen's casinos:

150
00:05:54,039 --> 00:05:57,120
The dealer is God,
and the dealer rules all.

151
00:05:57,399 --> 00:05:58,879
At my table,

152
00:05:58,880 --> 00:06:00,800
you play by my rules.

153
00:06:01,159 --> 00:06:02,518
Draws and extra hits,

154
00:06:02,519 --> 00:06:03,598
max ante.

155
00:06:03,599 --> 00:06:04,880
I'll allow everyone to cheat,

156
00:06:05,079 --> 00:06:07,519
as long as you allow me to step in.

157
00:06:08,240 --> 00:06:09,639
May the best player win.

158
00:06:10,978 --> 00:06:12,059
Interesting.

159
00:06:13,218 --> 00:06:15,059
Today, we're playing Ghost Showdown.

160
00:06:15,532 --> 00:06:17,972
The basic rules follow
traditional stud poker.

161
00:06:18,546 --> 00:06:19,546
With one difference:

162
00:06:19,580 --> 00:06:22,179
I'll slip a Joker into every deck.

163
00:06:25,714 --> 00:06:27,473
Think of it as a wild card.

164
00:06:27,474 --> 00:06:28,875
The winner of the previous hand

165
00:06:29,315 --> 00:06:31,754
gets to draw an extra card in this round.

166
00:06:31,755 --> 00:06:33,594
Now, let the game begin.

167
00:06:41,479 --> 00:06:42,479
Alright.

168
00:06:42,680 --> 00:06:43,760
Hole cards are dealt.

169
00:06:44,719 --> 00:06:45,880
Queen of Spades to act.

170
00:06:46,639 --> 00:06:47,320
Fifty.

171
00:06:47,560 --> 00:06:48,159
Call.

172
00:06:48,399 --> 00:06:49,399
Call.

173
00:06:50,200 --> 00:06:51,200
Fold.

174
00:06:58,000 --> 00:06:58,519
A hundred.

175
00:06:58,839 --> 00:06:59,159
Fold.

176
00:06:59,440 --> 00:07:00,440
Fold.

177
00:07:05,079 --> 00:07:06,079
Fold.

178
00:07:06,120 --> 00:07:06,639
Fold.

179
00:07:06,800 --> 00:07:07,120
Fold.

180
00:07:07,320 --> 00:07:08,320
Fold.

181
00:07:10,479 --> 00:07:10,959
Fold.

182
00:07:11,240 --> 00:07:12,240
Fold.

183
00:07:12,560 --> 00:07:13,039
Fold.

184
00:07:13,040 --> 00:07:14,879
Mr. Zhao keeps folding.

185
00:07:14,880 --> 00:07:16,200
Hard to tell what he's thinking.

186
00:07:16,880 --> 00:07:18,640
Young Master Qin is
on quite a streak today.

187
00:07:19,560 --> 00:07:21,039
This dealer isn't delivering.

188
00:07:21,479 --> 00:07:23,519
The players don't even
care to look at their cards.

189
00:07:23,839 --> 00:07:24,839
Dealer,

190
00:07:24,959 --> 00:07:27,120
did someone catch you stacking the deck?

191
00:07:28,320 --> 00:07:30,078
Then I suppose I'd better pay Young
Master Shen's casinos another visit

192
00:07:30,079 --> 00:07:31,120
to brush up on my skills.

193
00:07:33,680 --> 00:07:34,959
King of Hearts to act.

194
00:07:39,000 --> 00:07:40,000
Fifty.

195
00:07:41,399 --> 00:07:42,399
Fifty, call.

196
00:07:42,880 --> 00:07:43,880
Fold.

197
00:07:48,279 --> 00:07:49,279
Call.

198
00:07:50,320 --> 00:07:51,320
Mr. Zhao,

199
00:07:52,120 --> 00:07:54,240
does this hand suit your taste?

200
00:08:07,639 --> 00:08:08,639
A hundred.

201
00:08:08,680 --> 00:08:09,680
Call.

202
00:08:14,120 --> 00:08:15,120
Fold.

203
00:08:21,000 --> 00:08:22,000
Mr. Zhao,

204
00:08:22,039 --> 00:08:23,359
as the winner of the last round,

205
00:08:23,360 --> 00:08:25,399
you have the option to draw an extra card.

206
00:08:25,599 --> 00:08:26,599
Would you like one?

207
00:08:27,320 --> 00:08:28,559
Can I pick the card?

208
00:08:28,560 --> 00:08:29,599
By the rules,

209
00:08:29,680 --> 00:08:30,959
I have to draw it for you.

210
00:08:43,440 --> 00:08:44,440
Dealer,

211
00:08:44,879 --> 00:08:45,959
can I pass?

212
00:08:46,920 --> 00:08:47,920
You may.

213
00:09:06,479 --> 00:09:07,479
A hundred.

214
00:09:08,320 --> 00:09:09,320
Double.

215
00:09:11,280 --> 00:09:12,920
What if I have a straight flush?

216
00:09:13,479 --> 00:09:15,839
The odds of a straight flush
are fifteen in ten thousand.

217
00:09:16,680 --> 00:09:19,160
While the probability of
my straight is 0.39 percent.

218
00:09:20,160 --> 00:09:21,160
Care to raise again?

219
00:09:21,520 --> 00:09:22,600
If not, let's keep playing.

220
00:09:27,879 --> 00:09:28,879
Keep playing.

221
00:10:09,239 --> 00:10:10,239
Shengge,

222
00:10:10,479 --> 00:10:11,998
if your hole card is a Queen,

223
00:10:11,999 --> 00:10:12,999
it definitely beats mine.

224
00:10:13,280 --> 00:10:14,559
If it's not,

225
00:10:14,560 --> 00:10:16,239
my King still beats yours.

226
00:10:16,680 --> 00:10:17,680
Doesn't matter.

227
00:10:18,839 --> 00:10:19,839
All in.

228
00:10:20,239 --> 00:10:21,959
Plus a storefront on Nathan Road.

229
00:10:26,119 --> 00:10:27,119
Care to call?

230
00:10:30,520 --> 00:10:31,520
Fold.

231
00:10:34,400 --> 00:10:35,400
Three of Clubs.

232
00:10:36,040 --> 00:10:37,040
Pardon me.

233
00:10:40,560 --> 00:10:41,560
Zongnian,

234
00:10:42,119 --> 00:10:43,999
a dealer like that in your casino,

235
00:10:44,599 --> 00:10:46,598
his annual salary would
easily be this high, right?

236
00:10:46,599 --> 00:10:47,599
That's right.

237
00:10:48,400 --> 00:10:49,479
In British pounds, too.

238
00:10:55,320 --> 00:10:56,320
Fold.

239
00:10:56,560 --> 00:10:57,560
Fold.

240
00:10:57,599 --> 00:10:59,319
The Ace is already in my hand.

241
00:10:59,320 --> 00:11:01,878
Even if you draw the Nine
of Spades, it won't help.

242
00:11:01,879 --> 00:11:03,560
Ten storefronts on Prince Edward East.

243
00:11:05,800 --> 00:11:07,040
I want Qiongxi Estate.

244
00:11:10,879 --> 00:11:11,879
Call.

245
00:11:13,920 --> 00:11:14,920
Draw.

246
00:11:22,239 --> 00:11:23,400
I'll reveal it later.

247
00:11:23,800 --> 00:11:24,800
No problem.

248
00:11:26,719 --> 00:11:27,759
Certainly, Mr. Zhao.

249
00:11:42,400 --> 00:11:43,400
Show your cards, please.

250
00:11:47,599 --> 00:11:48,879
Straight flush!

251
00:11:51,079 --> 00:11:52,159
A King-high straight flush!

252
00:11:52,160 --> 00:11:53,679
Only a royal flush can beat it.

253
00:11:53,680 --> 00:11:55,080
And the Ace is already out of play.

254
00:11:55,239 --> 00:11:56,559
Zhao Shengge has definitely lost.

255
00:12:05,160 --> 00:12:06,160
Wait, what is that card?

256
00:12:15,999 --> 00:12:17,520
God strives to maintain fairness,

257
00:12:18,040 --> 00:12:20,200
yet the heart inevitably plays favorites.

258
00:12:20,959 --> 00:12:22,359
If Zhao Shengge needs it,

259
00:12:22,640 --> 00:12:24,040
he will find that card.

260
00:12:24,560 --> 00:12:25,799
And if he doesn't,

261
00:12:25,800 --> 00:12:27,359
it will stay hidden forever.

262
00:12:27,959 --> 00:12:28,959
Of course,

263
00:12:29,280 --> 00:12:31,440
I still hope he'll never have to use it.

264
00:12:32,040 --> 00:12:34,879
I want Zhao Shengge's path
to be smooth and unobstructed,

265
00:12:35,280 --> 00:12:36,600
and for everything to go his way.

266
00:12:38,320 --> 00:12:39,439
Alright, let's head inside.

267
00:12:39,440 --> 00:12:40,280
Mr. Chen,

268
00:12:40,281 --> 00:12:41,640
let's grab dinner sometime.

269
00:12:42,119 --> 00:12:42,999
You go ahead, everyone.

270
00:12:42,999 --> 00:12:43,640
I'll join you in a bit.

271
00:12:43,640 --> 00:12:43,959
Alright.

272
00:12:44,479 --> 00:12:44,959
Okay.

273
00:12:45,359 --> 00:12:46,359
Over here.

274
00:13:06,280 --> 00:13:08,480
Are you out here to take in
the view as well, Mr. Zhao?

275
00:13:09,719 --> 00:13:12,040
It's a great spot. Very comfortable.

276
00:13:18,200 --> 00:13:20,079
Luck was on your side tonight, Mr. Zhao.

277
00:13:26,680 --> 00:13:27,479
Mr. Zhao,

278
00:13:27,480 --> 00:13:29,680
take a breather. I won't disturb you.

279
00:13:30,280 --> 00:13:31,280
Chen Wan.

280
00:13:37,200 --> 00:13:38,400
I don't have a lighter.

281
00:14:02,440 --> 00:14:03,520
Why are you shaking?

282
00:14:11,680 --> 00:14:12,680
Damn.

283
00:14:12,920 --> 00:14:13,999
So gorgeous.

284
00:14:35,879 --> 00:14:36,520
I'm not.

285
00:14:36,839 --> 00:14:37,839
It's just a bit windy.

286
00:14:38,079 --> 00:14:39,399
This lighter of mine isn't anything fancy.

287
00:14:39,400 --> 00:14:40,720
Please make do with it, Mr. Zhao.

288
00:14:44,119 --> 00:14:45,598
I looked everywhere for you two.

289
00:14:45,599 --> 00:14:46,839
Turns out you're here.

290
00:14:47,560 --> 00:14:48,919
I came out to clear my head,

291
00:14:48,920 --> 00:14:50,280
and happened to run into Mr. Zhao.

292
00:14:50,520 --> 00:14:52,215
Come back in once
you've had enough fresh air.

293
00:14:52,239 --> 00:14:54,280
Youming is rushing
everyone back to the tables.

294
00:14:54,560 --> 00:14:55,598
Then, Mr. Zhao, I'll—.

295
00:14:55,599 --> 00:14:56,599
What's the rush?

296
00:14:57,479 --> 00:14:59,040
Can't even let a man finish his smoke.

297
00:15:00,160 --> 00:15:01,560
If you miss the auspicious hour,

298
00:15:02,079 --> 00:15:03,400
it brings bad luck, doesn't it?

299
00:15:05,280 --> 00:15:07,199
Mr. Qin takes feng shui very seriously.

300
00:15:07,200 --> 00:15:09,799
Even at the card table, he
checks which way he's facing,

301
00:15:09,800 --> 00:15:11,320
and waits for the most favorable hour.

302
00:15:16,079 --> 00:15:18,118
Mr. Zhao has won so much tonight,

303
00:15:18,119 --> 00:15:20,280
he's just saving a bit
of luck for the rest of us.

304
00:15:20,839 --> 00:15:21,999
And what about you, Mr. Chen?

305
00:15:28,160 --> 00:15:29,559
I'll stay here for a while,

306
00:15:29,560 --> 00:15:32,280
to soak up a bit of
Mr. Zhao's good fortune.

307
00:15:33,440 --> 00:15:34,079
Mr. Qin,

308
00:15:34,280 --> 00:15:36,640
let's see if the charm works at the table.

309
00:15:36,959 --> 00:15:37,959
Fine.

310
00:15:38,280 --> 00:15:40,200
Let's see if that luck truly rubs off.

311
00:15:54,999 --> 00:15:55,999
Give it to me.

312
00:15:56,999 --> 00:15:57,999
No need.

313
00:16:05,239 --> 00:16:07,598
Mr. Shi, your luck is incredible.

314
00:16:07,599 --> 00:16:08,718
Just so-so.

315
00:16:08,719 --> 00:16:10,520
That's quite a haul.

316
00:16:10,879 --> 00:16:12,359
I refuse to believe I can't beat you.

317
00:16:12,959 --> 00:16:13,959
Come on, another round.

318
00:16:20,359 --> 00:16:21,359
Young Master Huang.

319
00:16:21,520 --> 00:16:22,119
Mr. Shi.

320
00:16:22,119 --> 00:16:23,119
Mr. Su.

321
00:16:23,239 --> 00:16:24,680
Still playing Ghost Showdown?

322
00:16:25,999 --> 00:16:26,999
Chen Wan.

323
00:16:28,400 --> 00:16:29,400
Come join in.

324
00:16:30,320 --> 00:16:31,879
The table's full, though.

325
00:16:36,200 --> 00:16:37,200
You guys go ahead.

326
00:16:39,839 --> 00:16:41,479
Young Master Huang,
thank you.

327
00:16:43,400 --> 00:16:43,879
Gentlemen,

328
00:16:43,879 --> 00:16:44,879
the game is on.

329
00:16:49,040 --> 00:16:50,040
Place your bets.

330
00:16:52,719 --> 00:16:53,719
Fold.

331
00:16:58,479 --> 00:16:59,479
Pardon me.

332
00:16:59,599 --> 00:17:00,839
Thank you for going easy on me.

333
00:17:01,320 --> 00:17:01,800
Fold.

334
00:17:02,280 --> 00:17:03,280
Fold.

335
00:17:03,879 --> 00:17:04,879
Fold.

336
00:17:06,280 --> 00:17:08,080
Isn't this basically
handing over free money?

337
00:17:08,920 --> 00:17:10,000
He might be giving it away,

338
00:17:10,920 --> 00:17:12,160
but the others certainly won't.

339
00:17:13,040 --> 00:17:14,040
Chen Wan,

340
00:17:14,160 --> 00:17:16,359
who knew you played cards
even better than you deal them?

341
00:17:16,360 --> 00:17:17,439
I have to give credit to

342
00:17:17,440 --> 00:17:19,120
the luck Mr. Zhao lent me.

343
00:17:21,239 --> 00:17:22,239
Or rather,

344
00:17:23,200 --> 00:17:24,200
this luck

345
00:17:24,360 --> 00:17:25,559
was me returning the favor.

346
00:17:28,039 --> 00:17:28,600
Everyone,

347
00:17:28,680 --> 00:17:29,680
show your cards.

348
00:17:33,319 --> 00:17:34,718
My apologies, gentlemen.

349
00:17:34,719 --> 00:17:35,640
When luck strikes,

350
00:17:35,641 --> 00:17:36,680
there's no stopping it.

351
00:17:39,080 --> 00:17:40,080
Chen Wan,

352
00:17:40,680 --> 00:17:42,479
where did Mr. Zhao's borrowed luck go?

353
00:17:42,840 --> 00:17:45,080
Borrowed luck always runs dry eventually.

354
00:17:45,920 --> 00:17:46,519
By the way,

355
00:17:46,680 --> 00:17:47,680
Chen Wan,

356
00:17:47,840 --> 00:17:50,240
I'm worried you won't have
enough cash to cover your losses.

357
00:17:50,479 --> 00:17:51,120
How about

358
00:17:51,120 --> 00:17:52,120
that watch on your wrist?

359
00:17:52,239 --> 00:17:53,279
Put it on the table.

360
00:17:55,999 --> 00:17:57,119
It's a personal item.

361
00:17:57,120 --> 00:17:58,120
It's not worth much.

362
00:17:59,360 --> 00:18:00,080
Shengge,

363
00:18:00,081 --> 00:18:01,481
we've watched stud poker all night.

364
00:18:02,080 --> 00:18:03,239
Got anything else in mind?

365
00:18:05,799 --> 00:18:07,360
You're full of demands.

366
00:18:08,080 --> 00:18:09,080
What do you want to play?

367
00:18:10,319 --> 00:18:12,719
I recall Mr. Su studied in the UK.

368
00:18:14,840 --> 00:18:15,959
Why don't we play.

369
00:18:16,239 --> 00:18:17,239
Whist?

370
00:18:18,959 --> 00:18:20,199
I know that one well.

371
00:18:20,200 --> 00:18:22,600
Not sure about the rest of you, though.

372
00:18:23,120 --> 00:18:24,120
I'm fine with it.

373
00:18:26,160 --> 00:18:27,160
I'm game.

374
00:18:27,360 --> 00:18:28,839
Then Whist it is.

375
00:18:28,840 --> 00:18:29,840
Sounds good.

376
00:18:31,719 --> 00:18:32,360
Whist

377
00:18:32,400 --> 00:18:34,120
is played with two opposing teams.

378
00:18:34,559 --> 00:18:35,799
Partners sit facing each other.

379
00:18:36,200 --> 00:18:38,238
A trump suit will be drawn,

380
00:18:38,239 --> 00:18:40,039
becoming the highest trump for the hand.

381
00:18:40,319 --> 00:18:41,439
The trump suit for this hand

382
00:18:41,759 --> 00:18:42,759
is hearts.

383
00:18:43,920 --> 00:18:45,439
There are thirteen tricks in total.

384
00:18:45,440 --> 00:18:46,879
The team that takes the most tricks

385
00:18:46,880 --> 00:18:48,479
wins the game.

386
00:18:48,999 --> 00:18:50,839
Isn't Whist a lot like bridge?

387
00:18:50,840 --> 00:18:52,840
Bridge actually evolved from Whist.

388
00:18:53,640 --> 00:18:54,319
Except

389
00:18:54,320 --> 00:18:55,360
there's no dummy hand,

390
00:18:55,840 --> 00:18:56,840
and no bidding.

391
00:18:58,840 --> 00:18:59,880
I'll lead this round.

392
00:19:00,559 --> 00:19:02,319
We're taking at least ten tricks.

393
00:19:03,239 --> 00:19:04,360
Chen Wan, are you with me?

394
00:19:05,360 --> 00:19:06,360
I'm with you.

395
00:19:07,959 --> 00:19:08,959
Then count me in too.

396
00:19:09,840 --> 00:19:10,958
I'm betting you two

397
00:19:10,959 --> 00:19:11,959
won't make ten tricks.

398
00:19:12,600 --> 00:19:13,600
Chen Wan,

399
00:19:14,279 --> 00:19:15,920
if I play, I play to win.

400
00:19:18,719 --> 00:19:19,719
Of course.

401
00:19:20,279 --> 00:19:20,920
Mr. Shi,

402
00:19:21,239 --> 00:19:22,239
lead a card.

403
00:19:22,959 --> 00:19:24,640
There are only thirteen tricks in a hand.

404
00:19:25,519 --> 00:19:26,998
Zhao Shengge wants ten?

405
00:19:26,999 --> 00:19:27,920
That's absurd.

406
00:19:27,921 --> 00:19:30,561
Don't ever mistake Zhao Shengge
for someone who bluffs recklessly.

407
00:19:33,759 --> 00:19:34,759
One trick.

408
00:19:48,999 --> 00:19:50,080
Two tricks.

409
00:20:05,360 --> 00:20:06,519
Three tricks.

410
00:20:07,080 --> 00:20:08,080
Mr. Zhao,

411
00:20:08,759 --> 00:20:10,238
we only need one more trick,

412
00:20:10,239 --> 00:20:11,479
and you lose.

413
00:20:11,880 --> 00:20:14,279
Let's bet everything we've
won at the table tonight.

414
00:20:14,920 --> 00:20:16,999
I'll add another storefront
on Prince Edward East.

415
00:20:17,799 --> 00:20:18,799
Mr. Su,

416
00:20:19,039 --> 00:20:21,680
stake your plot near Jiaoxi Tower.

417
00:20:23,680 --> 00:20:24,840
I'll match you.

418
00:20:28,120 --> 00:20:29,080
Wan's King of Hearts—

419
00:20:29,081 --> 00:20:30,319
why didn't he play it earlier?

420
00:20:30,440 --> 00:20:33,039
Now it's trumped. He lost a high card.

421
00:20:33,400 --> 00:20:34,400
He's baiting them.

422
00:20:36,039 --> 00:20:37,039
One trick.

423
00:20:56,680 --> 00:20:57,680
Two tricks.

424
00:21:07,319 --> 00:21:08,319
Three tricks.

425
00:21:10,640 --> 00:21:12,600
If Mr. Su holds the Queen of Hearts,

426
00:21:13,440 --> 00:21:14,799
aren't they finished?

427
00:21:15,200 --> 00:21:16,200
Not a chance.

428
00:21:22,920 --> 00:21:23,920
Four tricks.

429
00:21:24,160 --> 00:21:25,200
He really doesn't have it.

430
00:21:25,519 --> 00:21:27,038
Zhao Shengge is ruthless, though.

431
00:21:27,039 --> 00:21:28,399
Flushing out trumps without mercy,

432
00:21:28,600 --> 00:21:29,920
not even sparing his own partner.

433
00:21:34,600 --> 00:21:35,400
How did Zhao Shengge know

434
00:21:35,401 --> 00:21:36,759
that Wan had the King of Hearts?

435
00:21:37,039 --> 00:21:38,120
Five tricks.

436
00:21:39,959 --> 00:21:41,680
They've been exchanging looks all night.

437
00:21:41,799 --> 00:21:42,840
Didn't you notice?

438
00:21:51,600 --> 00:21:52,600
Six tricks.

439
00:21:55,279 --> 00:21:56,279
The game is over.

440
00:22:00,239 --> 00:22:01,239
Seven tricks.

441
00:22:12,279 --> 00:22:13,279
Queen of Clubs.

442
00:22:24,880 --> 00:22:25,880
Eight tricks.

443
00:22:37,239 --> 00:22:38,239
Nine tricks.

444
00:22:51,160 --> 00:22:52,160
King of Hearts.

445
00:22:52,719 --> 00:22:53,680
The Knight Card.

446
00:22:53,681 --> 00:22:54,958
By high-society tradition,

447
00:22:54,959 --> 00:22:56,359
whoever receives Zhao Shengge's Knight Card

448
00:22:56,360 --> 00:22:57,880
can ask him for a favor.

449
00:22:57,999 --> 00:22:59,039
Any favor at all.

450
00:23:00,719 --> 00:23:01,719
It's gone.

451
00:23:01,999 --> 00:23:03,160
The Knight Card...

452
00:23:06,239 --> 00:23:07,279
What does he mean by that?

453
00:23:08,999 --> 00:23:09,999
Leaving already?

454
00:23:10,279 --> 00:23:11,279
Let's go.

455
00:23:12,479 --> 00:23:13,479
Let's go drink, then.

456
00:23:13,680 --> 00:23:15,400
I know where a great bottle is at the bar.

457
00:23:18,200 --> 00:23:19,200
Wan,

458
00:23:26,880 --> 00:23:28,240
could you clear the cards, please?

459
00:23:28,400 --> 00:23:29,400
We've got another round.

460
00:23:34,559 --> 00:23:35,559
Clear the deck.

461
00:23:35,799 --> 00:23:36,200
Let's keep going.

462
00:23:36,200 --> 00:23:37,200
Sure.

463
00:23:46,479 --> 00:23:47,479
Thank you.

464
00:23:49,640 --> 00:23:50,640
For what?

465
00:23:50,799 --> 00:23:52,959
For lending me your luck, Mr. Zhao.

466
00:23:53,559 --> 00:23:54,559
Don't mention it.

467
00:23:59,920 --> 00:24:00,920
Wan,

468
00:24:04,880 --> 00:24:07,000
didn't Zhao Shengge lose
a storefront to you earlier?

469
00:24:07,200 --> 00:24:09,520
How about I trade you a
plot in the outer district for it?

470
00:24:11,160 --> 00:24:13,278
I also won one on Mingwang Road.

471
00:24:13,279 --> 00:24:14,879
Why don't we trade for that one instead?

472
00:24:15,999 --> 00:24:16,519
Sure.

473
00:24:16,719 --> 00:24:17,719
Thank you.

474
00:24:18,080 --> 00:24:19,080
My pleasure.

475
00:24:19,239 --> 00:24:20,239
Take care.

476
00:24:27,519 --> 00:24:28,519
Xuan.

477
00:24:28,559 --> 00:24:29,080
What's wrong?

478
00:24:29,440 --> 00:24:30,720
Upset because you lost too much?

479
00:24:31,120 --> 00:24:32,120
Wan,

480
00:24:32,719 --> 00:24:34,840
why didn't you take Zhao
Shengge's Knight Card?

481
00:24:35,959 --> 00:24:37,215
I didn't think it was appropriate.

482
00:24:37,239 --> 00:24:38,919
Men like Zhao Shengge and Shen Zongnian

483
00:24:38,920 --> 00:24:40,440
never wager a Knight Card.

484
00:24:40,719 --> 00:24:42,879
Do you have any idea how
green with envy everyone was?

485
00:24:43,160 --> 00:24:44,519
What a terrible waste!

486
00:24:44,920 --> 00:24:46,200
It was the King of Hearts.

487
00:24:46,640 --> 00:24:47,719
Too suggestive.

488
00:24:48,039 --> 00:24:49,160
I know.

489
00:24:50,039 --> 00:24:51,799
Those are usually meant for showgirls.

490
00:24:52,600 --> 00:24:54,200
But you don't need to overthink it.

491
00:24:54,559 --> 00:24:56,238
Take things as they come.

492
00:24:56,239 --> 00:24:57,798
Zhao Shengge wouldn't think twice about it.

493
00:24:57,799 --> 00:24:59,319
But I would.

494
00:24:59,680 --> 00:25:00,680
Xuan,

495
00:25:01,360 --> 00:25:02,920
that's not what I'm after.

496
00:25:03,279 --> 00:25:04,640
I won't be a lover on the side,

497
00:25:04,999 --> 00:25:06,360
and I don't do ambiguity.

498
00:25:07,120 --> 00:25:09,919
Then why didn't you trade Tan
Youming for the storefront he wanted?

499
00:25:10,200 --> 00:25:11,200
That's different.

500
00:25:11,680 --> 00:25:12,798
The storefront at Wangchun Point,

501
00:25:12,799 --> 00:25:15,080
Zhao Shengge played the
room specifically to win it.

502
00:25:15,559 --> 00:25:17,640
The hand just happened to fall to me,

503
00:25:17,799 --> 00:25:18,880
so it became mine.

504
00:25:19,239 --> 00:25:20,479
I can think of it

505
00:25:21,039 --> 00:25:22,120
as a gift from him.

506
00:25:23,519 --> 00:25:24,519
Chen Wan,

507
00:25:24,799 --> 00:25:25,799
are you out of your mind?

508
00:25:27,160 --> 00:25:29,160
Haven't you always thought I was crazy?

509
00:25:29,920 --> 00:25:31,120
I am sick.

510
00:25:32,080 --> 00:25:33,640
I can't control myself.

511
00:25:34,640 --> 00:25:37,519
If this feeling ever crosses
the line and breaks open,

512
00:25:38,400 --> 00:25:40,799
I will never let Zhao Shengge go.

513
00:25:41,999 --> 00:25:43,600
Whether he loves me or not.

514
00:25:43,880 --> 00:25:45,400
Don't let your mind run wild.

515
00:25:45,719 --> 00:25:46,319
Monica said

516
00:25:46,320 --> 00:25:47,839
as long as you stick with therapy,

517
00:25:47,840 --> 00:25:49,200
it's not impossible.

518
00:25:50,600 --> 00:25:51,600
You're just...

519
00:25:52,559 --> 00:25:53,559
Don't worry about me.

520
00:25:53,719 --> 00:25:54,719
I'm fine.

521
00:25:54,840 --> 00:25:56,200
I can still keep myself in check.

522
00:25:56,880 --> 00:25:58,600
I know exactly what I want.

523
00:26:03,360 --> 00:26:04,519
Platonic unrequited love—

524
00:26:05,160 --> 00:26:06,280
isn't that what you call it?

525
00:26:06,719 --> 00:26:07,719
That's right.

526
00:26:08,719 --> 00:26:10,920
It's the cardinal rule
of my secret devotion.

527
00:26:11,440 --> 00:26:12,640
Unshakeable.

528
00:26:13,200 --> 00:26:14,759
Even Zhao Shengge himself

529
00:26:16,120 --> 00:26:17,319
cannot break it.

530
00:26:17,920 --> 00:26:18,920
Yes.

531
00:26:19,559 --> 00:26:20,719
Yet only he

532
00:26:20,959 --> 00:26:22,279
is worth keeping it for.

533
00:26:22,640 --> 00:26:24,319
No one else could ever compare.

534
00:26:26,200 --> 00:26:26,519
Alright.

535
00:26:26,880 --> 00:26:27,880
Xuan,

536
00:26:28,039 --> 00:26:29,039
get some rest.

537
00:27:08,759 --> 00:27:09,400
Zhao—

538
00:27:09,400 --> 00:27:10,400
Mr. Zhao...

539
00:27:15,680 --> 00:27:16,680
Get out.

540
00:27:31,120 --> 00:27:32,120
Out.

541
00:27:38,319 --> 00:27:39,319
Chen Wan.

542
00:27:39,680 --> 00:27:41,279
If I play, I play to win.

543
00:27:43,519 --> 00:27:44,519
Just getting back?

544
00:27:47,120 --> 00:27:47,840
Mr. Qin.

545
00:27:48,039 --> 00:27:49,039
Not asleep yet?

546
00:27:49,999 --> 00:27:51,239
Heading out to look at the sea.

547
00:27:51,440 --> 00:27:51,840
And you?

548
00:27:52,120 --> 00:27:53,120
Why aren't you asleep?

549
00:27:53,719 --> 00:27:54,239
Mr. Qin,

550
00:27:54,240 --> 00:27:55,719
I just went for a walk to digest.

551
00:27:56,559 --> 00:27:58,360
You're being too formal, Wan.

552
00:27:58,600 --> 00:27:59,680
Just call me Zhaoting.

553
00:28:00,080 --> 00:28:01,319
Tan Youming calls me that.

554
00:28:01,719 --> 00:28:02,920
Can we be friends?

555
00:28:15,319 --> 00:28:16,319
Mr. Zhao.

556
00:28:17,519 --> 00:28:18,239
Shengge.

557
00:28:18,479 --> 00:28:19,519
Why aren't you asleep yet?

558
00:28:19,840 --> 00:28:21,080
Are you finished,

559
00:28:21,840 --> 00:28:23,000
or have you not even started?

560
00:28:24,279 --> 00:28:25,958
Chatting outside someone's
door in the dead of night—

561
00:28:25,959 --> 00:28:26,999
isn't that a bit impolite?

562
00:28:27,759 --> 00:28:28,759
I'm sorry, Mr. Zhao.

563
00:28:28,840 --> 00:28:30,120
Sorry for disturbing your sleep.

564
00:28:30,999 --> 00:28:31,600
Wan,

565
00:28:31,880 --> 00:28:32,960
you have great card skills.

566
00:28:33,440 --> 00:28:34,800
Maybe we could talk shop sometime?

567
00:28:35,400 --> 00:28:36,400
Mr. Qin,

568
00:28:36,440 --> 00:28:37,440
I'm going to sleep.

569
00:28:38,799 --> 00:28:39,799
Chen Wan.

570
00:28:40,799 --> 00:28:41,840
Which floor is the bar on?

571
00:28:42,319 --> 00:28:42,920
On the second floor.

572
00:28:43,319 --> 00:28:44,799
Are you heading down for a drink now?

573
00:28:44,999 --> 00:28:45,999
Too loud to sleep.

574
00:28:47,880 --> 00:28:48,880
I'm really sorry.

575
00:28:49,239 --> 00:28:50,935
How about I go with
you to pick a bottle?

576
00:28:50,959 --> 00:28:52,120
Consider it my apology.

577
00:28:53,039 --> 00:28:54,039
Let's go.

578
00:28:55,279 --> 00:28:56,279
This way, please.

579
00:29:01,039 --> 00:29:02,880
Care to join us for a drink, Mr. Qin?

580
00:29:04,400 --> 00:29:05,920
I'll pass on the drink.

581
00:29:06,080 --> 00:29:07,279
The night is young.

582
00:29:08,519 --> 00:29:10,478
There are much better
things to do than drink.

583
00:29:10,479 --> 00:29:11,479
Then, Mr. Qin,

584
00:29:11,680 --> 00:29:13,120
have a good time tonight.

585
00:29:13,880 --> 00:29:15,599
Didn't I tell you to just call me Zhaoting?

586
00:29:15,600 --> 00:29:16,600
Can we go now?

587
00:29:16,640 --> 00:29:17,279
Mr. Zhao,

588
00:29:17,279 --> 00:29:18,279
this way, please.

589
00:29:34,999 --> 00:29:36,559
What would you like to drink, Mr. Zhao?

590
00:29:37,319 --> 00:29:38,319
You choose.

591
00:29:41,840 --> 00:29:42,958
Then how about this one?

592
00:29:42,959 --> 00:29:44,120
The Earl of Eternity.

593
00:29:44,279 --> 00:29:45,319
It's rich and full-bodied,

594
00:29:45,479 --> 00:29:46,640
and it helps with sleep.

595
00:29:46,920 --> 00:29:47,959
I hope you like it.

596
00:29:48,719 --> 00:29:49,719
Sounds good.

597
00:29:50,759 --> 00:29:51,759
Excuse me, sir.

598
00:29:54,680 --> 00:29:56,478
We'd like this bottle of Earl of Eternity.

599
00:29:56,479 --> 00:29:58,360
Could you please decant
it for us? Thank you.

600
00:30:00,719 --> 00:30:01,719
I'm warning you.

601
00:30:02,999 --> 00:30:04,440
I don't want to see

602
00:30:04,719 --> 00:30:06,160
any unfamiliar creatures in my room.

603
00:30:07,559 --> 00:30:08,680
It wasn't me.

604
00:30:08,920 --> 00:30:10,239
Why would I ever do that?

605
00:30:10,640 --> 00:30:13,120
I'm terrified of being tossed
into the ocean to feed the fish.

606
00:30:19,239 --> 00:30:20,120
Enjoy your drinks, gentlemen.

607
00:30:20,120 --> 00:30:21,120
Mr. Zhao, give it a try.

608
00:30:21,759 --> 00:30:22,759
Blackcurrant.

609
00:30:23,239 --> 00:30:24,239
Black cherry.

610
00:30:24,799 --> 00:30:25,799
Violet.

611
00:30:26,759 --> 00:30:27,759
Chen Wan.

612
00:30:28,080 --> 00:30:29,279
You have great taste in wine.

613
00:30:30,440 --> 00:30:31,960
It's been rather hot in Haishi lately.

614
00:30:44,759 --> 00:30:45,759
Chen Wan.

615
00:30:46,319 --> 00:30:47,959
You don't seem very happy.

616
00:30:48,880 --> 00:30:51,160
You're talking even less than
when Qin Zhaoting was here.

617
00:30:51,999 --> 00:30:52,999
Are you tired?

618
00:30:54,319 --> 00:30:55,319
No.

619
00:31:22,039 --> 00:31:23,120
If you're tired,

620
00:31:23,360 --> 00:31:24,360
you can head back first.

621
00:31:30,360 --> 00:31:30,840
Alright, then.

622
00:31:31,120 --> 00:31:31,799
Mr. Zhao,

623
00:31:32,039 --> 00:31:33,176
I'll head back and get some rest.

624
00:31:33,200 --> 00:31:34,215
Take your time with the wine.

625
00:31:34,239 --> 00:31:36,239
Feel free to call me
anytime if you need anything.

626
00:33:36,703 --> 00:33:40,963
[TN: He's riffing on Tang dynasty poetry about
two people sharing a view despite being apart.]

627
00:33:47,230 --> 00:33:50,210
[TN: He's posting
it publicly on his WeChat]

628
00:34:27,610 --> 00:34:32,116
[His bank is letting him know he just
spent unbelievable amounts of money]

629
00:34:36,600 --> 00:34:37,600
Hello?

630
00:34:38,000 --> 00:34:39,278
I noticed my mom recently made

631
00:34:39,279 --> 00:34:41,120
several large transactions.

632
00:34:41,520 --> 00:34:43,160
Could you tell me where she's been going?

633
00:34:45,080 --> 00:34:47,560
City of Dreams and Wynn Macau, right?

634
00:34:48,040 --> 00:34:49,040
Okay, I understand.

635
00:34:49,279 --> 00:34:49,919
If anything comes up,

636
00:34:49,920 --> 00:34:51,239
keep me posted.

637
00:35:08,239 --> 00:35:09,960
Sir, here is your necklace.

638
00:35:10,279 --> 00:35:11,719
Your girlfriend is going to love it.

639
00:35:11,759 --> 00:35:12,759
Thank you.

640
00:35:13,160 --> 00:35:14,280
It's actually for my mother.

641
00:35:14,560 --> 00:35:15,480
My apologies.

642
00:35:15,481 --> 00:35:17,640
Your mother must be a very beautiful woman.

643
00:35:18,919 --> 00:35:19,919
Thank you.

644
00:35:20,000 --> 00:35:21,000
You're welcome.

645
00:36:20,960 --> 00:36:21,480
Excuse me,

646
00:36:21,960 --> 00:36:23,640
could you wrap this up for me too?

647
00:36:24,239 --> 00:36:25,560
These two in the third row.

648
00:36:25,600 --> 00:36:25,960
Of course.

649
00:36:26,000 --> 00:36:26,399
Thank you.

650
00:36:26,399 --> 00:36:27,399
Right away.

651
00:36:29,960 --> 00:36:30,399
Wan.

652
00:36:30,719 --> 00:36:31,879
You like intricate craftwork?

653
00:36:32,560 --> 00:36:33,480
From this Eaves Tile series,

654
00:36:33,481 --> 00:36:35,096
the "Eternal Infinity"
piece doesn't really suit you.

655
00:36:35,120 --> 00:36:36,320
It's too austere and imposing.

656
00:36:36,879 --> 00:36:37,879
Mr. Qin.

657
00:36:38,600 --> 00:36:39,239
It's fine.

658
00:36:39,239 --> 00:36:40,239
It's a gift for a friend.

659
00:36:41,080 --> 00:36:42,680
Your friends are so lucky, then.

660
00:36:43,000 --> 00:36:44,359
I wonder who the lucky person is.

661
00:36:45,279 --> 00:36:47,239
Being Mr. Qin's friend
must be just as wonderful.

662
00:36:47,759 --> 00:36:48,759
Do you really think so?

663
00:36:53,799 --> 00:36:54,799
Mr. Zhao.

664
00:36:57,319 --> 00:36:59,439
Sir, please take a look at your cufflinks.

665
00:36:59,960 --> 00:37:00,960
Thank you.

666
00:37:01,279 --> 00:37:02,279
Please wrap them up.

667
00:37:04,359 --> 00:37:05,919
I didn't realize you had a friend

668
00:37:06,279 --> 00:37:07,879
who suited cufflinks like these.

669
00:37:59,040 --> 00:38:00,080
Hello, Mom.

670
00:38:00,279 --> 00:38:01,239
Baby,

671
00:38:01,240 --> 00:38:03,279
come with me to Tin Hau Temple tomorrow.

672
00:38:03,600 --> 00:38:07,438
Dr. Du said my qi is stagnant, hurting
my liver, and I've got excess dampness.

673
00:38:07,439 --> 00:38:08,718
I had a reading done.

674
00:38:08,719 --> 00:38:11,120
I should pray to Mazu to clear it up.

675
00:38:12,160 --> 00:38:12,600
Mom,

676
00:38:12,719 --> 00:38:13,918
did you use the credit card again today?

677
00:38:13,919 --> 00:38:16,599
Baby, pick me up tomorrow at 4:30.

678
00:38:16,600 --> 00:38:18,200
Don't forget, okay?

679
00:38:18,640 --> 00:38:19,200
Pung!

680
00:38:19,359 --> 00:38:20,399
Gotta go. Bye!

681
00:38:36,520 --> 00:38:37,239
From now on,

682
00:38:37,520 --> 00:38:38,520
I'll bring this with me.

683
00:38:49,439 --> 00:38:50,000
Grandfather,

684
00:38:50,319 --> 00:38:51,319
rest assured.

685
00:38:52,319 --> 00:38:54,520
I have our partnership
with the Zhaos well in hand.

686
00:38:55,040 --> 00:38:56,399
Doing business

687
00:38:56,960 --> 00:38:59,120
all comes down to whether your hole cards

688
00:38:59,879 --> 00:39:00,919
are strong enough.

689
00:39:03,560 --> 00:39:03,960
Alright.

690
00:39:04,279 --> 00:39:06,839
Next, let's look at the Gantt
chart for the Lai Chun Wun project.

691
00:39:07,080 --> 00:39:09,039
The Gantt chart is structured
around the project's

692
00:39:09,040 --> 00:39:10,438
24-month construction cycle.

693
00:39:10,439 --> 00:39:12,959
It precisely maps out the start and
completion dates for each phase,

694
00:39:12,960 --> 00:39:13,759
the construction duration,

695
00:39:13,760 --> 00:39:15,280
and the transition between each stage.

696
00:39:15,680 --> 00:39:16,680
Directly...

697
00:39:20,000 --> 00:39:22,360
It directly reflects the project's
implementation schedule.

698
00:39:23,160 --> 00:39:24,160
It's all set.

699
00:39:32,480 --> 00:39:33,480
Hello?

700
00:39:34,560 --> 00:39:35,839
Xu Zhiying is back.

701
00:39:37,239 --> 00:39:38,358
I've already made the arrangements.

702
00:39:38,359 --> 00:39:39,479
No need to trouble yourself.

703
00:39:40,200 --> 00:39:42,399
Did you go to Tin Hau
Temple to pray for Lai Chun Wun?

704
00:39:42,680 --> 00:39:45,440
For major ventures, you should pay
respects to the Empress of Heaven.

705
00:39:45,480 --> 00:39:47,120
I've never believed in gods or spirits.

706
00:39:47,759 --> 00:39:48,839
It's tradition.

707
00:39:52,960 --> 00:39:54,120
My meeting wraps up at 4:30.

708
00:39:54,399 --> 00:39:55,399
I'll head over then.

709
00:39:55,520 --> 00:39:55,879
You...

710
00:39:56,120 --> 00:39:57,718
Aren't you quite the big deal?

711
00:39:57,719 --> 00:40:00,119
Even the Bodhisattva has to
wait for your meeting to finish.

712
00:40:03,120 --> 00:40:04,239
Then let's continue.

713
00:40:12,040 --> 00:40:15,718
I told you, what happened
at the casino wasn't my fault.

714
00:40:15,719 --> 00:40:17,718
I was wondering why I felt so groggy.

715
00:40:17,719 --> 00:40:19,279
Turns out it was all that dampness.

716
00:40:19,600 --> 00:40:22,718
This time, I'll light fine incense
for the Heavenly Empress.

717
00:40:22,719 --> 00:40:24,079
Let's burn the most expensive one.

718
00:40:25,799 --> 00:40:26,878
I really don't get it.

719
00:40:26,879 --> 00:40:28,040
Couldn't you just stay away?

720
00:40:28,879 --> 00:40:31,119
I specifically consulted a master.

721
00:40:31,120 --> 00:40:32,238
On the 24th of the lunar month,

722
00:40:32,239 --> 00:40:32,640
the Goddess conveys prayers to Heaven.

723
00:40:32,640 --> 00:40:33,439
Why is he here?

724
00:40:33,439 --> 00:40:34,439
What is he doing here?

725
00:40:34,600 --> 00:40:35,600
Baby,

726
00:40:35,839 --> 00:40:37,200
what are you spacing out for?

727
00:40:39,279 --> 00:40:40,319
I'll wait outside for you.

728
00:40:40,960 --> 00:40:41,839
Go in by yourself.

729
00:40:41,840 --> 00:40:42,878
We came together!

730
00:40:42,879 --> 00:40:45,079
The Empress will be
displeased if you don't pray.

731
00:40:45,080 --> 00:40:46,936
You should only visit the Heavenly
Empress once every three months.

732
00:40:46,960 --> 00:40:48,039
Praying to Mazu too often

733
00:40:48,040 --> 00:40:49,536
will make her think mortals are greedy.

734
00:40:49,560 --> 00:40:51,319
You just prayed to Lin Moniang last month.

735
00:40:51,600 --> 00:40:52,878
Why not go to the West Hall this time

736
00:40:52,879 --> 00:40:55,040
and speak with Jingyun Mazu instead?

737
00:40:55,960 --> 00:40:58,199
But the master specifically told me...

738
00:40:58,200 --> 00:40:59,240
As long as you're sincere,

739
00:40:59,399 --> 00:41:01,080
Mazu will definitely bless you.

740
00:41:01,799 --> 00:41:02,799
Tell you what.

741
00:41:02,960 --> 00:41:04,159
When we get back, I'll commission another

742
00:41:04,160 --> 00:41:05,559
mutton-fat jade statue
of the Goddess for you.

743
00:41:05,560 --> 00:41:07,160
Then you can pray to Mazu at home.

744
00:41:07,960 --> 00:41:08,960
How does that sound?

745
00:41:09,799 --> 00:41:10,799
That works too.

746
00:41:11,319 --> 00:41:11,919
Come on, come on.

747
00:41:12,239 --> 00:41:13,239
Let's pray.

748
00:41:14,239 --> 00:41:15,040
The auspicious hour is upon us.

749
00:41:15,040 --> 00:41:15,960
Heaven and Earth open.

750
00:41:15,961 --> 00:41:17,921
Light the incense, kneel,
and bow with reverence.

751
00:41:18,200 --> 00:41:19,639
Incense burns in the censer,

752
00:41:19,640 --> 00:41:21,199
its divine smoke reaching
ten thousand miles.

753
00:41:21,200 --> 00:41:22,519
Petition the gods when in need;

754
00:41:22,520 --> 00:41:24,040
disturb them not when all is at peace.

755
00:41:27,120 --> 00:41:28,879
Mr. Zhao's devotion is sincere.

756
00:41:29,319 --> 00:41:31,159
Empress Mazu will surely hear it.

757
00:41:31,160 --> 00:41:33,600
Reclaiming land for the port at Lai Chun Wun

758
00:41:33,960 --> 00:41:36,120
benefits both the people and commerce.

759
00:41:36,640 --> 00:41:39,438
Yet it must align with heavenly
timing and earthly fortune

760
00:41:39,439 --> 00:41:41,080
for harmony and success to follow.

761
00:41:41,719 --> 00:41:42,719
Mr. Zhao,

762
00:41:42,960 --> 00:41:43,960
it's about time.

763
00:41:44,000 --> 00:41:45,000
We should get going.

764
00:41:45,239 --> 00:41:46,239
Alright.

765
00:41:46,680 --> 00:41:47,080
Master,

766
00:41:47,600 --> 00:41:48,720
thank you for your guidance.

767
00:41:48,839 --> 00:41:50,119
If anything else comes up,

768
00:41:50,120 --> 00:41:51,839
just contact my special assistant.

769
00:41:52,200 --> 00:41:53,200
Understood.

770
00:41:54,439 --> 00:41:55,719
Thank you for your time, Master.

771
00:41:56,120 --> 00:41:56,839
Mr. Zhao,

772
00:41:56,839 --> 00:41:57,480
I won't keep you from your work.

773
00:41:57,719 --> 00:41:59,439
Please give my regards to Elder Mr. Zhao.

774
00:42:00,839 --> 00:42:01,839
This way, please.

775
00:42:06,279 --> 00:42:07,279
Master,

776
00:42:08,560 --> 00:42:09,999
what do people pray for over there?

777
00:42:10,000 --> 00:42:11,839
The West Hall is for Jingyun Mazu,

778
00:42:11,960 --> 00:42:13,440
Left Attendant of the Heavenly Court,

779
00:42:13,799 --> 00:42:14,919
who governs wisdom.

780
00:42:16,640 --> 00:42:17,640
Wisdom?

781
00:42:18,319 --> 00:42:19,879
Does he really need to pray for wisdom?

782
00:42:20,600 --> 00:42:22,560
Is there anyone more calculating than him?

783
00:42:24,759 --> 00:42:26,560
When was this statue of the Goddess built?

784
00:42:27,279 --> 00:42:28,599
Decades ago.

785
00:42:28,600 --> 00:42:30,680
The gilt lacquer has
begun to fade and peel.

786
00:42:31,319 --> 00:42:34,838
We are currently
fundraising for its restoration.

787
00:42:34,839 --> 00:42:36,798
If you are inclined, Benefactor Zhao,

788
00:42:36,799 --> 00:42:38,879
you may follow me to
offer an incense stick.

789
00:42:39,560 --> 00:42:41,719
It would make for a good omen.

790
00:42:42,600 --> 00:42:43,600
Very well.

791
00:42:44,080 --> 00:42:45,080
Lucas,

792
00:42:45,239 --> 00:42:46,438
notify them that the upcoming meeting

793
00:42:46,439 --> 00:42:47,439
will be held online.

794
00:42:47,600 --> 00:42:48,600
Understood.

795
00:42:49,719 --> 00:42:50,719
This way, please.

796
00:42:54,560 --> 00:42:55,520
May Lady Jingyun

797
00:42:55,521 --> 00:42:56,599
bless Zhao Shengge

798
00:42:56,600 --> 00:42:58,200
with success in the Lai Chun Wun project.

799
00:43:15,640 --> 00:43:16,640
All done.

800
00:43:23,279 --> 00:43:24,279
Master.

801
00:43:25,520 --> 00:43:26,520
Mr. Zhao.

802
00:43:27,200 --> 00:43:28,000
Mr. Chen.

803
00:43:28,160 --> 00:43:29,160
Ms. Song.

804
00:43:29,439 --> 00:43:30,080
Baby,

805
00:43:30,080 --> 00:43:31,080
introduce us.

806
00:43:33,319 --> 00:43:34,480
This is Mr. Zhao.

807
00:43:36,200 --> 00:43:37,200
And this is my mother.

808
00:43:38,600 --> 00:43:39,239
Baby,

809
00:43:39,240 --> 00:43:41,438
why didn't you mention
that you know Mr. Zhao?

810
00:43:41,439 --> 00:43:41,759
Mom...

811
00:43:41,960 --> 00:43:42,759
Mr. Zhao,

812
00:43:42,960 --> 00:43:44,000
it's an honor to meet you.

813
00:43:44,200 --> 00:43:47,000
Has my Wan caused you any trouble?

814
00:43:47,359 --> 00:43:49,318
He isn't very worldly, you know.

815
00:43:49,319 --> 00:43:50,319
Mom,

816
00:43:50,600 --> 00:43:52,199
Mr. Zhao and I aren't close.

817
00:43:52,200 --> 00:43:54,438
I merely bumped into Mr. Zhao

818
00:43:54,439 --> 00:43:55,680
at a banquet once.

819
00:43:56,600 --> 00:43:57,600
Master,

820
00:43:58,520 --> 00:44:00,879
whether the gilded statue
needs recasting or repair,

821
00:44:01,239 --> 00:44:02,519
have someone prepare an estimate

822
00:44:02,680 --> 00:44:03,880
and send it directly to Lucas.

823
00:44:04,279 --> 00:44:06,879
Your benevolence brings
boundless merit, Mr. Zhao.

824
00:44:07,080 --> 00:44:08,798
Empress Mazu will surely bless you,

825
00:44:08,799 --> 00:44:10,999
bringing smooth progress to Lai Chun Wun

826
00:44:11,000 --> 00:44:12,520
and peace to your whole family.

827
00:44:13,600 --> 00:44:14,600
This way, please.

828
00:44:21,319 --> 00:44:22,758
How could you two not be close?

829
00:44:22,759 --> 00:44:24,359
He even greeted you!

830
00:44:24,439 --> 00:44:25,000
Mom,

831
00:44:25,319 --> 00:44:26,319
don't overthink it.

832
00:44:26,560 --> 00:44:27,560
We aren't close.

833
00:44:27,680 --> 00:44:28,840
He was just acknowledging us.

834
00:44:29,200 --> 00:44:30,279
Not close? Really?

835
00:44:30,839 --> 00:44:33,399
A grim reaper like him isn't
someone we should cross.

836
00:44:33,719 --> 00:44:35,719
Otherwise, no god can save us.

837
00:44:36,319 --> 00:44:37,759
What grim reaper?

838
00:44:38,120 --> 00:44:39,479
It's getting late.

839
00:44:39,480 --> 00:44:41,040
Let's head home once we finish praying.

840
00:44:43,799 --> 00:44:45,398
What grim reaper?

841
00:44:45,399 --> 00:44:46,680
It's getting late.

842
00:44:52,560 --> 00:44:53,040
Mom,

843
00:44:53,239 --> 00:44:54,200
we aren't close.

844
00:44:54,201 --> 00:44:55,361
He was just acknowledging us.

845
00:44:57,719 --> 00:45:00,080
A grim reaper like him isn't
someone we should cross.

846
00:45:00,560 --> 00:45:02,399
Otherwise, no god can save us.

847
00:45:17,200 --> 00:45:19,799
Redo the budget proposal for Lai Chun Wun.

848
00:45:20,160 --> 00:45:21,160
Why?

849
00:45:21,161 --> 00:45:22,520
What's the issue?

850
00:45:23,279 --> 00:45:24,399
This number is inauspicious.

851
00:45:27,080 --> 00:45:28,080
Zhao Shengge,

852
00:45:28,239 --> 00:45:29,960
what happened to you at Tin Hau Temple?

853
00:45:30,399 --> 00:45:31,918
We've worked on this project for so long,

854
00:45:31,919 --> 00:45:33,136
and only now you claim it's bad luck?

855
00:45:33,160 --> 00:45:33,960
Nian,

856
00:45:33,961 --> 00:45:35,200
talk some sense into him.

857
00:45:37,839 --> 00:45:39,120
It is a bit unlucky.

858
00:45:40,480 --> 00:45:41,960
Let's draft a new budget.

859
00:45:42,480 --> 00:45:43,799
Whatever you say.

860
00:45:55,080 --> 00:45:56,879
A grim reaper, huh?

861
00:46:10,359 --> 00:46:11,359
Four.

862
00:46:11,640 --> 00:46:12,640
Six.

863
00:46:13,120 --> 00:46:13,879
Eight.

864
00:46:13,880 --> 00:46:16,199
I heard Minglong is taking
an equity stake in Lai Chun Wun.

865
00:46:16,200 --> 00:46:17,000
Did you guys know?

866
00:46:17,001 --> 00:46:18,801
They even partnered
with the shipping tycoon.

867
00:46:19,640 --> 00:46:21,040
Everyone knows that.

868
00:46:21,560 --> 00:46:22,560
My dad told me

869
00:46:22,879 --> 00:46:24,838
if the Lai Chun Wun terminal is completed,

870
00:46:24,839 --> 00:46:25,719
at least eighty percent
of Haishi's cargo ships

871
00:46:25,720 --> 00:46:27,919
will have to berth here.

872
00:46:28,080 --> 00:46:30,520
Deep water, sheltered
harbor, long coastline—

873
00:46:31,000 --> 00:46:33,080
its cargo capacity blows
everyone else away.

874
00:46:33,319 --> 00:46:34,358
That impressive?

875
00:46:34,359 --> 00:46:35,959
Then once the terminal is built,

876
00:46:35,960 --> 00:46:37,399
I'm applying for the maiden voyage.

877
00:46:38,000 --> 00:46:39,079
Save your breath.

878
00:46:39,080 --> 00:46:40,358
Let's compete on merit.

879
00:46:40,359 --> 00:46:42,519
Friendship aside, business is business.

880
00:46:42,520 --> 00:46:43,918
This is major headline financial news!

881
00:46:43,919 --> 00:46:44,919
So?

882
00:46:45,239 --> 00:46:46,680
Did you catch that just now?

883
00:46:46,839 --> 00:46:48,120
Did you see how sharp I looked?

884
00:46:48,319 --> 00:46:49,319
I saw it.

885
00:46:50,040 --> 00:46:51,439
Three clean misses.

886
00:46:53,879 --> 00:46:54,879
Wan,

887
00:46:54,960 --> 00:46:56,798
you've been making jokes

888
00:46:56,799 --> 00:46:58,120
a lot more frequently lately.

889
00:46:58,759 --> 00:47:00,199
Looks like Monica's sessions

890
00:47:00,200 --> 00:47:01,719
are really paying off.

891
00:47:02,960 --> 00:47:04,600
Then I truly have you to thank.

892
00:47:05,000 --> 00:47:05,960
Don't mention it.

893
00:47:05,961 --> 00:47:07,479
Whatever else you want, just name it.

894
00:47:07,480 --> 00:47:09,279
Just don't ask for money—I'm broke.

895
00:47:10,080 --> 00:47:11,200
In that case, I want

896
00:47:11,480 --> 00:47:12,960
the maiden voyage at Lai Chun Wun.

897
00:47:18,799 --> 00:47:20,536
Now that's really putting
me on the spot, bro.

898
00:47:20,560 --> 00:47:21,000
Hey!

899
00:47:21,080 --> 00:47:23,200
Mr. Zhao, Tan, President Shen.

900
00:47:24,480 --> 00:47:25,359
What a coincidence!

901
00:47:25,360 --> 00:47:26,799
Speak of the devil.

902
00:47:27,279 --> 00:47:29,239
Welcome to my new shooting club.

903
00:47:29,480 --> 00:47:31,679
We were just talking about Lai Chun Wun,

904
00:47:31,680 --> 00:47:33,200
fighting for the maiden voyage rights.

905
00:47:33,600 --> 00:47:34,600
We can talk.

906
00:47:34,640 --> 00:47:35,640
Highest bidder takes it.

907
00:47:35,799 --> 00:47:37,680
I heard you're bumping up the budget.

908
00:47:38,719 --> 00:47:40,960
Someone thought the
number brought bad luck.

909
00:47:41,919 --> 00:47:42,919
Zhao Maozheng's idea?

910
00:47:42,943 --> 00:47:44,783
He's getting old...
superstitions are inevitable.

911
00:47:45,312 --> 00:47:47,153
None of you want a
Titanic day trip, do you?

912
00:47:47,520 --> 00:47:49,279
The old man may be too superstitious,

913
00:47:49,520 --> 00:47:51,319
but you don't give a damn either.

914
00:47:52,600 --> 00:47:53,600
Come on.

915
00:47:57,600 --> 00:47:58,160
Let's go.

916
00:47:58,239 --> 00:47:58,799
Let's take a break.

917
00:47:58,919 --> 00:48:00,079
Xuan, I'll pass.

918
00:48:00,080 --> 00:48:01,375
I'll practice shooting a bit more.

919
00:48:01,399 --> 00:48:02,399
You guys go ahead.

920
00:48:13,560 --> 00:48:14,080
Wan,

921
00:48:14,319 --> 00:48:15,319
how is it going?

922
00:48:17,480 --> 00:48:17,960
Wan,

923
00:48:18,279 --> 00:48:19,319
have you shot before?

924
00:48:19,799 --> 00:48:21,120
If you haven't,

925
00:48:21,319 --> 00:48:23,799
I recommend starting with
these two entry-level ones:

926
00:48:24,359 --> 00:48:25,398
the Roystar R100

927
00:48:25,399 --> 00:48:26,640
or the Falcon X5.

928
00:48:26,799 --> 00:48:29,000
The recoil feedback
feels remarkably authentic.

929
00:48:43,640 --> 00:48:44,840
Do you know how to hold a gun?

930
00:48:46,120 --> 00:48:47,120
Let me show you.

931
00:48:52,319 --> 00:48:53,319
Thank you, Mr. Qin.

932
00:48:53,560 --> 00:48:54,560
No need.

933
00:48:55,359 --> 00:48:57,438
I just watched and picked up the basics.

934
00:48:57,439 --> 00:48:58,439
I can manage on my own.

935
00:48:58,600 --> 00:48:59,918
I'm the host.

936
00:48:59,919 --> 00:49:01,559
Of course I should take care of everyone.

937
00:49:08,879 --> 00:49:09,359
Mr. Zhao.

938
00:49:09,600 --> 00:49:10,640
Just a little misfire.

939
00:49:16,919 --> 00:49:17,919
That's enough, Mr. Qin.

940
00:49:18,839 --> 00:49:19,999
I'll figure it out on my own.

941
00:49:36,359 --> 00:49:38,719
A grim reaper like him isn't
someone we should cross.

942
00:49:40,480 --> 00:49:42,120
A grim reaper...
